From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Brix Andersen <henrik@brixandersen.dk>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 23:04:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] usb: device_next: class: gs_usb: add missing
 net_buf_unref() on return

Add missing call to net_buf_unref() on early function return.

Signed-off-by: Henrik Brix Andersen <henrik@brixandersen.dk>
(cherry picked from commit 0fd5538d069d1411b18c291908e7348510ccf1df)
---
 subsys/usb/device_next/class/gs_usb.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/subsys/usb/device_next/class/gs_usb.c b/subsys/usb/device_next/class/gs_usb.c
index 2b10253..8f9125a 100644
--- a/subsys/usb/device_next/class/gs_usb.c
+++ b/subsys/usb/device_next/class/gs_usb.c
@@ -1024,6 +1024,7 @@ static void gs_usb_can_state_change_callback(const struct device *can_dev, enum
 		break;
 	case CAN_STATE_STOPPED:
 		/* Not reported */
+		net_buf_unref(buf);
 		return;
 	}
 
